# docs/ROADMAP.md is GENERATED (`tools/board.py`, ADR 2026-08-17-0545). Its
# per-section narrative lines render the README's path as the LINK TEXT
# (`*Narrative: [<section>/README.md](roadmap/<section>/README.md)*`), and
